@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Setting Up an Azure DevOps Organization";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <h1 class="text-center text-primary">Setting Up an Azure DevOps Organization</h1>
    <p class="lead text-center">Learn how to create and configure an Azure DevOps Organization for efficient project management and collaboration.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-success">Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Azure DevOps is a suite of tools provided by Microsoft for development teams to plan, develop, test, and deliver software efficiently. Setting up an Azure DevOps organization allows you to manage projects, repositories, pipelines, and more.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-devops-setup.jpg" alt="Azure DevOps Organization Setup" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure DevOps provides a cloud-based solution for development teams.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Steps to Set Up Azure DevOps Organization -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-info">Steps to Set Up an Azure DevOps Organization</h2>
        <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Sign In to Azure DevOps:</strong> Visit <a href="https://dev.azure.com/" target="_blank">Azure DevOps</a> and sign in with your Microsoft account.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Create an Organization:</strong> Click on <em>Create new organization</em>, enter a unique name, and select your region.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Set Up a Project:</strong> Choose a project name, select visibility (public or private), and pick a version control system (Git or TFVC).</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Configure Permissions:</strong> Add team members and set up their roles (Admin, Contributor, Reader, etc.).</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Integrate with Repositories:</strong> Link existing GitHub repositories or create new ones within Azure DevOps.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Set Up CI/CD Pipelines:</strong> Configure Azure Pipelines for automated build and deployment processes.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-devops-pipelines.jpg" alt="Azure DevOps CI/CD" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure Pipelines enable continuous integration and deployment.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits of an Azure DevOps Organization -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-warning">Benefits of an Azure DevOps Organization</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Centralized Project Management:</strong> Manage code, tasks, and pipelines in one place.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Efficient Collaboration:</strong> Work seamlessly with distributed teams using integrated tools.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Scalability:</strong> Supports teams of all sizes, from startups to enterprises.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Security and Compliance:</strong> Enforces role-based access and compliance with industry standards.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-devops-benefits.jpg" alt="Benefits of Azure DevOps" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure DevOps enhances software development workflows.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-danger">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Setting up an Azure DevOps Organization is a crucial step in streamlining software development processes. By leveraging Azure's powerful tools, teams can efficiently plan, develop, and deploy applications with ease.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-devops-future.jpg" alt="Future of Azure DevOps" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure DevOps continues to evolve, empowering developers worldwide.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>